      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 752,
        "content": "## FLOW AI FREE STARTER 01 | Kundenanfrage -> Google Sheets\n\n### How it works\n\nThe workflow captures a customer inquiry through an n8n form, normalizes key fields such as date, name, email, and phone number, then appends the data to Google Sheets. After the sheet write succeeds, it prepares a simple confirmation result for the requester or downstream handling.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the form trigger fields for the customer inquiry, including name, email, phone number, and any other required request details.\n- Connect Google Sheets credentials in n8n and select the target spreadsheet and worksheet in the Google Sheets node.\n- Ensure the normalized field names in the Set node match the column headers expected by the Google Sheet.\n- Test the form submission end to end to confirm rows are added and the confirmation output is returned.\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can add more form fields, adjust the normalization mapping, or change the confirmation message returned after saving."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "3d8be0d8-417f-4566-b6a4-d9b90a828ed0",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -464,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 464,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Capture and normalize request\n\nReceives the customer inquiry via a form trigger and formats the submitted data into consistent fields such as date, name, email, and phone number."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "dffaca75-61b8-4e6f-b015-cf31c9aae498",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        96,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Save and confirm\n\nStores the normalized inquiry in Google Sheets and creates a final confirmation result once the save step is complete."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
